# 1. Problem Space Co-Design Canvas (HCI)

## Problem

ED triage nurses must collect patient information, record vital signs, assess urgency, and document findings while working under time pressure.

---

## User

- ED triage nurse

---

## Inputs

- Patient demographics
- Chief complaint
- Medical history
- Vital signs from the Smart Triage Station
- Existing EHR information

---

## Outputs

- Predicted ESI level
- Confidence score
- Colour-coded urgency alert
- Explanation of contributing factors

---

