# 2. Problem Space Co-Design Canvas (HRI)

## Problem

Collecting patient-reported information and vital signs during triage can increase nurse workload and delay the creation of a complete patient record.

---

## User

- Patient
- ED nurse

---

## Inputs

- Handwritten symptoms using the Smart Pen
- Blood pressure
- Heart rate
- Oxygen saturation
- Temperature
- Weight
- Existing EHR information

---

## Outputs

- Digital handwriting
- Structured patient record
- Vital signs
- Predicted ESI level
- Critical alerts

---

## Human Action

The patient writes their symptoms using the Smart Pen and uses the connected vital-sign devices. The nurse reviews all collected information before accepting or overriding the AI recommendation.

